flowchart TB
  accTitle: Aster 运行时架构
  accDescr: 终端和桌面通过 ACP 接入 Core，Rust 应用直接创建会话。Core 调用模型和受控工具，并记录事实日志。
  subgraph host[产品宿主]
    terminal[Aster 终端]
    desktop[Aster 桌面]
    acp[ACP]
    rust[Rust 应用]
    terminal --> acp
    desktop --> acp
  end
  subgraph core[A3S Code / Core]
    session[AgentSession]
    harness[Meta Harness / FactRun]
    session --> harness
  end
  subgraph environment[工作环境]
    model[模型服务]
    tools[受控工具 / 工作区 / MCP]
    facts[事实日志]
  end
  acp --> session
  rust --> session
  harness <--> model
  harness --> tools
  harness --> facts
